---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Home
lang: en
description: Foreign Immigration Services is a Bureau of Immigration accredited consultancy that manages the visa, extension, residency and compliance process on your behalf in the Philippines.
---
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}
{% include "partials/urgent-banner.njk" %}

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero__grid">
    <p class="hero__eyebrow">Philippine Immigration Consultancy</p>
    <h1 class="hero__headline">Philippine immigration, handled.</h1>
    <p class="hero__lede">Foreign Immigration Services is a Bureau of Immigration accredited consultancy that manages Philippine immigration matters on your behalf, from visas, extensions and residency to corporate mobility, compliance and complex immigration concerns.</p>
    <div class="hero__visual">
      <img src="/assets/images/fis-logo.webp" alt="Foreign Immigration Services" width="612" height="408" class="hero__logo">
    </div>
    <div class="hero__actions">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Send an Enquiry</a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/services/">Explore Our Services</a>
    </div>
    <p class="hero__accreditation">
      {{ icon("accreditation", 40) }}
      <span><strong>Bureau of Immigration Accredited Consultancy</strong> — No. {{ site.accreditation.number }}</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__intro">
      <h2>Core Immigration Services</h2>
      <p>Our practice is organised across six core areas of immigration work.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid card-grid--3up">
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("visa-applications", 44) }}
        <h3>Visa &amp; Immigration Applications</h3>
        <p>Planning to enter, work, study or otherwise stay in the Philippines and unsure which visa applies to you?</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services/visa-and-immigration-applications/">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("work-visas", 44) }}
        <h3>Work &amp; Employment Visas</h3>
        <p>9(g) Pre-Arranged Employment Visa and other work-related immigration assistance for foreign nationals working in the Philippines.</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services/work-and-employment-visas/">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("extensions-compliance", 44) }}
        <h3>Extensions &amp; Compliance</h3>
        <p>Already in the Philippines and need to extend your stay or keep up with reporting requirements?</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services/extensions-and-compliance/">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("residency-status", 44) }}
        <h3>Residency &amp; Long-Term Status</h3>
        <p>Considering a longer-term or permanent move to the Philippines?</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services/residency-and-long-term-status/">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("family-spousal", 44) }}
        <h3>Family &amp; Spousal Visas</h3>
        <p>Married to, or the family of, someone in the Philippines and need to bring or keep your family together?</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services/family-and-spousal-visas/">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("corporate-mobility", 44) }}
        <h3>Corporate &amp; Global Mobility</h3>
        <p>Relocating employees or managing cross-border staff moving into the Philippines?</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services/corporate-and-global-mobility/">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feature-split feature-split--photo">
  <div class="wrap feature-split__grid">
    <div class="feature-split__content">
      <p class="tag">Featured Service</p>
      <h2>Airport VIP Meet &amp; Assist</h2>
      <p class="feature-split__lede">A smoother airport experience, from arrival to onward transport.</p>
      <p>Our Airport VIP Meet &amp; Assist service provides personalised assistance throughout the airport journey while observing all applicable airline, airport, Immigration, Customs, security and other government procedures.</p>
      <p><a class="btn btn-on-dark" href="/services/airport-vip-meet-and-assist/">Learn More About Airport VIP Meet &amp; Assist</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-split__visual feature-split__visual--photo">
      <img src="/assets/images/airport-vip-feature.webp" alt="A Foreign Immigration Services representative greeting a passenger and assisting with her luggage in an airport arrivals hall." width="1536" height="1024">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--muted">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__intro">
      <h2>Specialised Services</h2>
      <p>Focused assistance for specific, often time-sensitive, immigration situations.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid card-grid--4up">
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("status-review", 44) }}
        <h3>Immigration Status Review &amp; Regularisation Assistance</h3>
        <p>Uncertain about your immigration status, visa validity, or Bureau of Immigration records?</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services/immigration-status-review-and-regularisation/">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("motions-blacklist", 44) }}
        <h3>Immigration Motions, Blacklist &amp; Derogatory Record Assistance</h3>
        <p>Dealing with a blacklist, watchlist, or other derogatory immigration record?</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services/immigration-motions-blacklist-and-derogatory-record-assistance/">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("legal-support", 44) }}
        <h3>Legal Support for Foreign Nationals</h3>
        <p>Facing criminal or immigration proceedings in the Philippines?</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services/legal-support-for-foreign-nationals/">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("complex-tailored", 44) }}
        <h3>Complex &amp; Tailored Immigration Assistance</h3>
        <p>Tailored support for complex or unusual immigration circumstances involving multiple issues, processes or requirements.</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services/complex-and-tailored-immigration-assistance/">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("lost-passport", 44) }}
        <h3>Lost Passport &amp; Travel Document Assistance</h3>
        <p>Lost your passport or travel document while in the Philippines?</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services/lost-passport-and-travel-document-assistance/">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("acr-icard", 44) }}
        <h3>ACR I-Card Assistance</h3>
        <p>Need to register for, renew, or replace your Alien Certificate of Registration I-Card?</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services/acr-i-card-assistance/">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("exit-clearance", 44) }}
        <h3>Exit Clearance &amp; Departure Requirements</h3>
        <p>Leaving the Philippines after a long stay and unsure if you need clearance first?</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services/exit-clearance-and-departure/">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("document-verification", 44) }}
        <h3>Visa &amp; Immigration Document Verification</h3>
        <p>Need to verify the authenticity or status of a visa or immigration document?</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services/visa-and-immigration-document-verification/">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feature-split feature-split--compact">
  <div class="wrap feature-split__grid">
    <div class="feature-split__visual feature-split__visual--photo">
      <img src="/assets/images/property-transfer-bgc.webp" alt="A city skyline of glass high-rise towers in Bonifacio Global City, Manila, at sunset with a park in the foreground." width="1536" height="1024">
    </div>
    <div class="feature-split__content">
      <p class="tag">Featured Service</p>
      <h2>Property Transfer &amp; Documentation Support</h2>
      <p class="feature-split__lede">Buying, selling, or transferring property in the Philippines?</p>
      <p>FIS provides documentation and coordination support for property transfer transactions, including assistance with transfer documentation and coordination with relevant government agencies and professionals.</p>
      <p class="service-cta__actions">
        <a class="btn btn-on-dark" href="/services/property-transfer-and-documentation-support/">Learn More</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline-on-dark" href="/contact/?service=property-transfer">Make an Enquiry</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-banner">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Not Sure What You Need or Can't Find What You're Looking For?</h2>
    <p>You don't need to know the name of the visa, application or immigration process you need. Tell us what is happening, and our team can review your situation and help identify the appropriate next step.</p>
    <p><a class="btn btn-on-dark" href="/contact/?service=other">Tell Us Your Situation</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--muted">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__intro">
      <h2>Client Portal</h2>
      <p>Your applications and service requests, documents, messages, payments and profile, all in one place.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="portal-preview-grid">
      <div class="portal-preview-item">{{ icon("portal-applications", 32) }}<span>Applications &amp; Services</span></div>
      <div class="portal-preview-item">{{ icon("portal-upload", 32) }}<span>Documents</span></div>
      <div class="portal-preview-item">{{ icon("portal-enquiry", 32) }}<span>Messages</span></div>
      <div class="portal-preview-item">{{ icon("portal-payments", 32) }}<span>Payments</span></div>
      <div class="portal-preview-item">{{ icon("portal-profile", 32) }}<span>Profile</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-md"><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/client-portal/">Open the Client Portal →</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
